{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id129815519"}, "name":{"label":"7rainbow777"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2017-02-26T23:53:19-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"2.2"}, "id":{"label":"1553566728"}, "title":{"label":"Not much to it"}, "content":{"label":"I'm tried to get my head around why this is so popular and gets so many mentions all over there web. So I gave it ago. \n\nI found myself using it for six goals to complete. \n\nBut there's no substance to this app other than having six things to tick off by clicking big round buttons. \n\nSo I used a second app to keep sub lists, of what I needed to do to complete each streaks goal. Because streaks can't to that. \n\nThen it occurred to me...why not just use the other app for everything and delete streaks. So I did. \n\nStreaks is really, really nice on the surface but lacks any real functionality for me.\n\nOther people seem to love it and say it works for them, so please read the positive reviews too :)", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=963034692&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"4"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"4"}}, 
