{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id41992262"}, "name":{"label":"Amateur A"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2017-02-09T04:59:01-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"2.1.1"}, "id":{"label":"1540674139"}, "title":{"label":"Making new habits is hard"}, "content":{"label":"And that's where Streaks can help.\n\nI misunderstood at first - I thought I was getting this app to see how great I was at doing certain things. That was my mistake.\n\nInstead, Streaks is there to give you regular reminders through the day that encourage the formation of new, positive, habits.\n\nAnd for that it's great. I'm reading more, exercising more, and generally just getting much better at self care than I have been in the past.\n\nA great app that's improving over time. Recommended.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=963034692&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
